<form autocomplete="off">
  <p class="notes">Choose which LoreBridge feature categories are available in this world. Save Features stages your choices; use Save Changes in the parent Game Settings window to apply them.</p>
  <fieldset>
    <legend>Feature Categories</legend>
    <div class="form-group stacked">
      <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="uiButtonsEnabled" {{checked uiButtonsEnabled}}> Enable Foundry UI Buttons</label>
      <p class="hint">Show LoreBridge generation and suggestion buttons on supported actor, journal, and scene sheets.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group stacked">
      <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="chatCommandEnabled" {{checked chatCommandEnabled}}> Enable /lb Chat Command</label>
      <p class="hint">Allow LoreBridge questions, roleplay, city, and NPC commands in chat.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group stacked">
      <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="journalQaEnabled" {{checked journalQaEnabled}}> Enable Journal Page Q&amp;A Panel</label>
      <p class="hint">Show the Ask LoreBridge panel on journal sheets.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group stacked">
      <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="writesEnabled" {{checked writesEnabled}}> Enable AI-Proposed Writes</label>
      <p class="hint">Allow AI assistants to propose journal page updates. Every change still requires explicit GM approval.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group stacked">
      <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="npcMentionEnabled" {{checked npcMentionEnabled}}> Enable @NPC Mention Responses</label>
      <p class="hint">Allow players and the GM to address AI-enabled NPCs in chat using @ActorName. Enable individual NPCs with /lb npc enable &lt;name&gt;.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="form-group stacked">
      <label class="checkbox"><input type="checkbox" name="playerLoreEnabled" {{checked playerLoreEnabled}}> Enable Player Lore Assistant</label>
      <p class="hint">Allow players to ask questions with <code>/lb ask</code>, answered only from GM-published, player-visible journals. Configure the allowlist in Game Settings → Configure Player Lore.</p>
    </div>
  </fieldset>
  <footer class="sheet-footer flexrow"><button type="button" data-action="save"><i class="fas fa-save"></i> Save Features</button></footer>
</form>
